        "subheading_chDQgp": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "<p>True Haute Couture is defined as much by what remains unseen as by what the eye can admire.</p><p>Beneath every embroidery lies meticulous construction. Hand-finished corsetry, precise balance, refined interior finishing, and countless hours of skilled craftsmanship come together to create garments that are as remarkable inside as they are outside.</p><p>This unwavering pursuit of excellence is what gives every YARA SHOEMAKER creation its integrity, beauty, and lasting presence.</p>",
